# Agent playtest loop

Do not wait for the user to look at the game. After **feel, art, audio, weapons, HUD, netcode, or other playable** work, follow [`.cursor/skills/verify-blat/SKILL.md`](../skills/verify-blat/SKILL.md) (default feature: `demo-spectator`).

Short version:

1. `npm test` and `bash scripts/verify-blat-doctor.sh`.
2. Open **http://localhost:5173/demo** with computerUse (no password). After a Fly deploy also **https://blat.fly.dev/demo**.
3. Watch several seconds of combat. Read the LAG line and `curl http://localhost:2567/api/lag`.
4. Never print `BLAT_PASSWORD`. Say so when a VM cannot judge internet RTT, iPhone Safari audio, or two-human lag.

`npm test` does not replace a look at `/demo`. Looking at `/demo` does not replace `npm test`.
